ok - an update where every step works runs all of them, in order
ok - an unattended update approves orphan removal
ok - a finished update clears the shell update indicator without rechecking
ok - -y is what marks an update unattended, not the update itself
ok - a confirmed update approves orphan removal
ok - an update restarts the shell before migrating only when migrations are pending
ok - a blocked package upgrade stops the update before it migrates
